-- en: "Official source repository. The action bars are the EllesmereUIActionBars folder. Source availability does not certify integration behavior."
L["Official source repository. The action bars are the EllesmereUIActionBars folder. Source availability does not certify integration behavior."] = "官方源码仓库。动作条即 EllesmereUIActionBars 文件夹。有源码可用并不代表认证了集成行为。"
-- en: "BigWigs plugin for dungeon and delve bosses. Requires BigWigs and feeds the same bars and stages, so the BigWigs row covers it; no separate RM connection."
L["BigWigs plugin for dungeon and delve bosses. Requires BigWigs and feeds the same bars and stages, so the BigWigs row covers it; no separate RM connection."] = "适用于地下城和探索副本首领的 BigWigs 插件。需要 BigWigs，并提供相同的计时条和阶段，因此 BigWigs 一行已涵盖它；没有单独的 RM 连接。"
-- en: "DBM module pack for dungeons, delves and events. Requires DBM-Core and registers through it, so the DBM row covers it; no separate RM connection."
L["DBM module pack for dungeons, delves and events. Requires DBM-Core and registers through it, so the DBM row covers it; no separate RM connection."] = "适用于地下城、探索副本和事件的 DBM 模块包。需要 DBM-Core 并通过它注册，因此 DBM 一行已涵盖它；没有单独的 RM 连接。"
